WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.334
DISPATCHER: (OVER PHONE)
<i> 911. What is your emergency?</i>

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.703
MELODY HERZFELD:<i> We were
 in the middle of rehearsal,</i>

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:04.870
<i> in the middle of a scene.</i>

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.205
I heard some shots.

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:09.175
-(SIREN WAILING)
<i> -It was like being
 in a war zone.</i>

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.245 line:0%
BOY 1: (OVER PHONE)

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:15.181
At first, everyone was still
trying to figure out

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.616
<i> how to process all of this.</i>

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:19.084
BOY 2:<i> You always hear,
 "The show must go on."</i>

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.054
<i>When we all came back to school,</i>

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.922
we all knew
what we needed to do.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.457
This was something
we had to finish.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.559
<i>Especially something like this,
 which is for kids.</i>

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.028
HERZFELD:
This is our "Begin Again."

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:31.398
It is the most important show
that you're doing,

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:33.033
probably ever.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.968
GIRL 1:<i> We had to finish this</i>

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:38.538
to show our community
that we can move on.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:42.275
We want to bring happiness
to the school again.

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.278
-What do we want?
-PROTESTERS: Change!

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.912
-When do we want it?
-PROTESTERS: Now!

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:49.983
GIRL 2:<i> Even though these
bad things have happened to us,</i>

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.651
beautiful things
can come out of it.

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:53.920
<i>♪ Even in the darkest of times ♪</i>

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:57.557
HERZFELD:
<i> When they came back to school,
 I said, "I promise you,</i>

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.759
that life is so good."

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:02.695
<i> ♪ Beautiful things can grow ♪</i>

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:06.599
(PROTESTERS CHANTING)

